4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
First, open the previous bedhead file you made.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000
You can also download this file from the shortcut at the bottom of this video.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,000
To make a three-dimensional bedhead effect, select the two lines on the front of the bedhead.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
In the menu bar on the right-hand side, select the line to be made according to the curve.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
The line to be made according to the curve will be divided into two parts.

9
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,000
To create a three-dimensional bedhead effect, select the front of the bedhead and the outer part of the bedhead.

10
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Then select the new bedhead and make a joint.

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:10,000
After making a joint, you can modify the size of the bedhead separately without affecting other bedheads.

12
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Then freeze the other two layers of bedhead.

13
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Open the model and let the bedhead be divided.

14
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:30,000
In order to make a three-dimensional bedhead effect, you need to stretch the outer part of the bedhead horizontally.

15
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:37,000
In this way, you can have enough volume to be opened.

16
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Stretch it again and turn on the model to check the effect.

17
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Change the pressure to 10 to get the effect of a three-dimensional bedhead.

18
00:01:53,000 --> 00:02:03,000
Since the inflow effect is not more obvious, increase the pressure to 50 to get a more obvious inflow effect.

19
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Checking the bedhead, you will see that the bedhead between the outer layer and the middle layer of the panel is biased.

20
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:30,000
The bedhead between the outer layer and the middle layer of the panel is parallel to the entire circle of the panel.

21
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:34,000
Therefore, the bedhead is biased only when the horizontal width is widened.

22
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:44,000
The bedhead between the outer layer and the middle layer of the panel is parallel to the entire circle of the panel.

23
