24
00:02:53,000 --> 00:03:01,000
The width of the möbler or the width of the bedhead is equal to the width of the upper layer of the panel.

25
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:09,000
In order to create a more accurate bedhead, select the upper and lower edge of the upper and lower layers of the two layers panel, and select an increase point at the intersection point in the menu to draw it in.

26
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:13,000
The two lines are now in this position.

27
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:17,000
These two lines will be cut off according to the internal line, which is convenient for sewing.

28
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:24,000
Use the free sewing tool to sew the two sides together first.

29
